| `input_adb_lookup(a.csv)`
| `input_adb_lookup(b.csv)`
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="a.csv", "a", source_lookup="b.csv", "b")
| search _key=*
```### Merge: only the keys go through adbmerge, the result is joined back by row id ###```
| `adb_merge(25, 50)`
```### Clusters that were too large to merge go to assetdb_overflow for review, not into assetdb ###```
| `adb_save_overflow`
| where isnull(adb_overflow)
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| outputlookup override_if_empty=false assetdb
